From 485a7be1247f3fb48b3eeeb814d8e35b26343a5c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Francesco \"Dil3mm4\" Manzo" <dil3mm4.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 09:52:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Adapt Pokopia Link Play to NX2Apple nxnative host

Integrate the imported multiplayer modules with the pinned engine HLE dispatch, real and virtual socket handling, per-title Pokopia observation gates, Mac app capability metadata and documented DM_COOP switches. Preserve the existing EventFd and shader-chain behavior. Original standalone modules remain credited separately to xFractals.

Upstream-Status: pending

Reason: Port and extend the imported Pokopia multiplayer stack for this NX2Apple engine and game profile

Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#161
